00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:57.430
1.

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:59.120
Let me get rid of some other tracks.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:04.290
I can get rid of that one also.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.940
You may or may not know, you can also move
