00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:15.199
If I want to put this hub track up there below
the genes a track I can do that.

00:12:15.199 --> 00:12:18.949
Let's say I want to focus in on a particular
gene region.

00:12:18.949 --> 00:12:23.460
I can go back up to the search widget.

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:25.899
Let's look for the CSK gene.

00:12:25.899 --> 00:12:28.670
The c-terminal src kinase gene.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:36.829
So it is now going to focus on that region.

00:12:36.829 --> 00:12:39.320
Here we have our track hub.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:46.120
I moved it up so that it is in between these
